message: "If you use these datasets, please cite them as below."
type: dataset
title: "Aptdot Developer Datasets"
abstract: "Ten free JSON test datasets and fixtures for developers: HTTP security headers, RBAC users, MCP server configs, FHIR R4 patients, JWT claims and signed test tokens, CI/CD templates, an e-commerce catalog, IANA time zones, ISO country and currency codes, and design color tokens. Each file has a JSON Schema."
